{"title":"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4e4e5c6d549ce47918b94180cad5c1644d9ea88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of girls and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of boys in a class got an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a5579a24419ec2b27af62227edbd0214d46f671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{&#39;A&#39;}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />. If there are only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students in the class who got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a5579a24419ec2b27af62227edbd0214d46f671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{&#39;A&#39;}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />s and the ratio of boys and girls in the class is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/5/445f67e0debd5e4569df74e1a256b3efae6eed61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4:5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"32\" height=\"13\" />, how many students are there in the class?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d95d42d65cb204933a631de26774b6fa115417c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2}{5}g + \\frac{1}{2}b = 12\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78796c063ee13ba00f45399fa6ba802d2e37400b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5b = 4g \\Longrightarrow b = \\frac{4}{5}g\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Substituting, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/309143d6ff4f8dd3afac2701093e7026466f69c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{5}g + \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac 45g\\right) = 12 \\Longrightarrow \\frac{4}{5}g = 12 \\Longrightarrow g = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"346\" height=\"43\" />. So there are 12 boys, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/c/3fce1ed82b1ef2f6d3aef667aecccf4edfd9f7ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 + 15 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> students in the class.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC\" title=\"1997 PMWC\">1997 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">Problem I6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">Problem I8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"1997 PMWC Proble